tion, usually a knowledge base. More commonly, QA systems can pull answers from an unstructured collection of natural language documents. Here a similar attempt at solving the problem has been performed, where part of a article from Wikipedia has been used as corpus and was tested against different type of questions that the program can answer correctly. Advanced QA requires sophisticated text processing tools based on state-of-the-art NLP.","topics":[],"score":230656,"global_rank":108029},{"name":"zliwow/Tetris-Game-Java","owner":"zliwow","html_url":"https://github.com/zliwow/Tetris-Game-Java","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":230654,"global_rank":108037},{"name":"therealruthvik/DineMaster","owner":"therealruthvik","html_url":"https://github.com/therealruthvik/DineMaster","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":230654,"global_rank":108049},{"name":"rishav-karanjit/AWS-DB-ESDK-Java-playground","owner":"rishav-karanjit","html_url":"https://github.com/rishav-karanjit/AWS-DB-ESDK-Java-playground","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"Personal playground for AWS DB-ESDK","topics":[],"score":230654,"global_rank":108056},{"name":"Monica20030707/RGB_to_picture","owner":"Monica20030707","html_url":"https://github.com/Monica20030707/RGB_to_picture","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This code will read a text file of RGB number and turn it into the pixel, with defined numbers of grid at the beginning of the text file.","topics":[],"score":230654,"global_rank":108059},{"name":"matthewryangranger/javalib","owner":"matthewryangranger","html_url":"https://github.com/matthewryangranger/javalib","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This is a repo that exhibits the behavior of a java library, the java collections classes. I will make my 